          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 26 2017 10:56:24 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Contact us</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Send us a message to learn more about&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Pro-Toe C2<span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;Hammertoe Fixation System</span></span></span></h4>\n",
